    {
      "id": "scene-07",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "God's Calendar",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-07",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-07-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "God told Moses and Aaron — this month will be your first month. On the tenth day, every family must choose a lamb — a year-old male, without blemish. And on the fourteenth day, at twilight, they must kill it.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-07/scene-07-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 16.44,
          "duration_frames": 493
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-07-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "God always has a plan — and a clock!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-07/scene-07-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.413,
          "duration_frames": 102
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-lamb-bleat-1",
          "description": "a soft single lamb bleat, gentle and childlike",
          "timing": "start",
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-lamb-bleat-1.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.0
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 20.453,
      "duration_frames": 614
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-08",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Bring the Lamb Home",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-08",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1b.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-08-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "So every Israelite family chose a perfect little lamb and brought it into their home. They cared for it for four days — petting it, feeding it, learning to love it. The lamb became part of the family.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-08/scene-08-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 14.164,
          "duration_frames": 425
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-08-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Have you ever loved a little animal?",
          "emotion": "curious",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-08/scene-08-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.287,
          "duration_frames": 69
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 17.051,
      "duration_frames": 512
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-09",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Blood on the Door",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-09",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1c.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-09-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "At twilight on the fourteenth day, the father killed the lamb. Then he took a hyssop branch, dipped it in the blood, and brushed the blood on the lintel and the two side-posts of the door.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-09/scene-09-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 12.841,
          "duration_frames": 385
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-09-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The blood was a sign — this house belongs to God.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-09/scene-09-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.413,
          "duration_frames": 102
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-09-line-03",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "When God sees the blood, He will pass over you.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-09/scene-09-line-03.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.355,
          "duration_frames": 101
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-brush-stroke",
          "description": "a single soft brush stroke on wood, gentle and reverent",
          "timing": "with-line:scene-09-line-01",
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-brush-stroke.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.5
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 20.809,
      "duration_frames": 624
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-10",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Eat in Haste!",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-10",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1d.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-10-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "That same night, the family ate the meal inside — roasted lamb, flat unleavened bread, and bitter herbs. Cloaks tucked in, sandals on, staff in hand.",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-10/scene-10-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 11.088,
          "duration_frames": 333
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-10-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Eat it in haste — it is the Lord's Passover!",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-10/scene-10-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.135,
          "duration_frames": 94
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-10-line-03",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Can you pretend to eat something yummy, really fast?",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-10/scene-10-line-03.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.587,
          "duration_frames": 108
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 19.01,
      "duration_frames": 570
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-11",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Midnight",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-11",
        "type": "section-header",
        "bg_color": "#1a1a45",
        "eyebrow": "✦ PART TWO ✦",
        "title": "Midnight",
        "footer": "Exodus 12:21-32",
        "animation": "fade-in"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-11-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Part Two. Midnight. The Destroyer passes.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-11/scene-11-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.599,
          "duration_frames": 108
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-low-rumble",
          "description": "very low distant thunder rumble, gentle, not scary, just a deep hum in the night",
          "timing": "start",
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-low-rumble.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.5
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 5.099,
      "duration_frames": 153
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-12",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Pass Over!",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-12",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-2a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-12-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "At midnight, the Lord passed through the land of Egypt. Every house without the blood on the door — the destroyer came inside. But every house WITH the blood — the Lord passed over.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-12/scene-12-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 12.133,
          "duration_frames": 364
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-12-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The blood is the sign that saves.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-12/scene-12-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.554,
          "duration_frames": 77
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 15.288,
      "duration_frames": 459
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-13",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "The Firstborn",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-13",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-2b.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-13-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "In every Egyptian home without the blood, the firstborn — from Pharaoh's palace to the prisoner's cell — fell asleep and did not wake. There was loud wailing all over Egypt.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-13/scene-13-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 14.652,
          "duration_frames": 440
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-13-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Not one house in Egypt was without someone gone.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-13/scene-13-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 4.11,
          "duration_frames": 123
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-13-line-03",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "It was a deeply sad night. God does not stay quiet forever.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-13/scene-13-line-03.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 5.12,
          "duration_frames": 154
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 25.082,
      "duration_frames": 752
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-14",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Pharaoh's Last Plea",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-14",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-2c.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-14-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "In the middle of the night, Pharaoh sent for Moses and Aaron. He was done fighting. He begged them — Rise up! Go! Take your flocks, your families — go!",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-14/scene-14-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 9.694,
          "duration_frames": 291
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-14-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The mighty hand of God had won.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-14/scene-14-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.891,
          "duration_frames": 87
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-14-line-03",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "When God decides, even Pharaoh cannot stop it.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-14/scene-14-line-03.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.738,
          "duration_frames": 112
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-door-open",
          "description": "a single heavy palace door creaking open",
          "timing": "with-line:scene-14-line-01",
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-door-open.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.5
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 17.524,
      "duration_frames": 526
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-15",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Leave Now!",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-15",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-2d.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-15-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "All the Egyptians urged the Israelites to leave at once. Go now — or we'll all die! They were done with God's people staying.",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-15/scene-15-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 9.474,
          "duration_frames": 284
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-15-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The Lord made the Egyptians willing to let them go.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-15/scene-15-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.599,
          "duration_frames": 108
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-15-line-03",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "When God opens a door, nobody can shut it!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-15/scene-15-line-03.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.32,
          "duration_frames": 100
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 17.593,
      "duration_frames": 528
    },
