    {
      "id": "scene-17",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "The Wages They Were Owed",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-17",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-3a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-17-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Before they left, the Israelites asked their Egyptian neighbors for silver and gold and clothing — the wages for all those years of hard work. And the Egyptians gave it freely.",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-17/scene-17-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 11.471,
          "duration_frames": 344
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-17-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "God had made the Egyptians willing to bless His people.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-17/scene-17-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 4.029,
          "duration_frames": 121
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-17-line-03",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "If someone has hurt you, ask God to bless them — like this!",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-17/scene-17-line-03.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 4.621,
          "duration_frames": 139
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-coins-jingle",
          "description": "a gentle jingle of small coins being handed over, warm and happy",
          "timing": "with-line:scene-17-line-01",
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-coins-jingle.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.5
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 21.32,
      "duration_frames": 640
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-18",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "The Great March-Out",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-18",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-3b.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-18-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "That very day, the Israelites left Rameses — about six hundred thousand men, plus women and children and many other people, with their flocks and herds. They headed for Succoth.",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-18/scene-18-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 12.295,
          "duration_frames": 369
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-18-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "After four hundred and thirty years — the very day — they were free!",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-18/scene-18-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 4.76,
          "duration_frames": 143
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-18-line-03",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "God keeps His promises down to the very day!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-18/scene-18-line-03.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 4.087,
          "duration_frames": 123
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-footsteps-march",
          "description": "a soft rhythmic patter of many footsteps, like a small crowd walking together, hopeful and steady",
          "timing": "with-line:scene-18-line-01",
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-footsteps-march.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.5
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 22.342,
      "duration_frames": 670
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-19",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Keep This Day",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-19",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-3c.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-19-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Moses taught the elders — this is a permanent law. From generation to generation, the Israelites will eat the Passover meal and remember this night.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-19/scene-19-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 10.902,
          "duration_frames": 327
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-19-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "To this day, the children of Israel remember.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-19/scene-19-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.599,
          "duration_frames": 108
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-19-line-03",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "When you remember what God has done, you stay strong!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-19/scene-19-line-03.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.634,
          "duration_frames": 109
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 19.335,
      "duration_frames": 580
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-20",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "The Bridge — The Lamb of God",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-20",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-4a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns",
        "verse_overlay": true
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-20-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "And here is the beautiful secret of the whole story.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-20/scene-20-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.831,
          "duration_frames": 115
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-20-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Behold, the Lamb of God, who takes away the sin of the world. — John one, twenty-nine.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-20/scene-20-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 7.581,
          "duration_frames": 227
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-20-line-03",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Jesus is the Lamb of God — and His blood covers us forever.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-20/scene-20-line-03.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 5.352,
          "duration_frames": 161
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-gentle-chime-bridge",
          "description": "a single soft celestial chime, reverent and bright",
          "timing": "start",
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-gentle-chime-bridge.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.5
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 17.965,
      "duration_frames": 539
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-21",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Angela's Diary",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-21",
        "type": "section-header",
        "bg_color": "#5a2a45",
        "eyebrow": "✦ ANGELA'S DIARY ✦",
        "title": "Dear\nDiary",
        "footer": "What Angela is learning today…",
        "animation": "fade-in"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-21-line-01",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "Hi everyone! It's Angela. Can I share my diary with you? I learned four things today!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-21/scene-21-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 5.793,
          "duration_frames": 174
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-page-turn",
          "description": "a soft storybook page turning, paper crinkling gently",
          "timing": "start",
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-page-turn.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.5
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 5.793,
      "duration_frames": 174
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-22",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Diary 1 — Pray, Don't Pay Back",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-22",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-3a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns",
        "diary_card": true
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-22-line-01",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "Number one! The Israelites were slaves for four hundred and thirty years. God told them to ask for their wages — and the Egyptians gave silver, gold, and clothing.",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-22/scene-22-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 9.892,
          "duration_frames": 297
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-22-line-02",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "I should pray for those who despitefully use me. I certainly will — because the children of Israel got the wages for their labor before they left!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-22/scene-22-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 8.011,
          "duration_frames": 240
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 18.503,
      "duration_frames": 555
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-23",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Diary 2 — The Blood on My Door",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-23",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1c.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns",
        "diary_card": true
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-23-line-01",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "Number two! The blood on the door was the sign — this home belongs to God. The destroyer passed over.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-23/scene-23-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 6.049,
          "duration_frames": 181
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-23-line-02",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "The blood of Jesus must be on me as a sign that I am a child of God — otherwise the messenger of death will come to me, like he came to the Egyptians.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-23/scene-23-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 7.988,
          "duration_frames": 240
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 14.637,
      "duration_frames": 439
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-24",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Diary 3 — God Keeps Every Promise",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-24",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-2c.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns",
        "diary_card": true
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-24-line-01",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "Number three! God promised to deliver Israel with a mighty hand. At midnight, Pharaoh begged them to leave.",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-24/scene-24-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 7.036,
          "duration_frames": 211
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-24-line-02",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "God promised Moses that He would deliver the Israelites by a powerful hand — and He did! Whatever God promises me, He will fulfill. I believe!",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-24/scene-24-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 8.742,
          "duration_frames": 262
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 16.378,
      "duration_frames": 491
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-25",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Diary 4 — Keep Hearing God",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-25",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns",
        "diary_card": true
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-25-line-01",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "Number four! Moses heard God and kept believing — even after Pharaoh refused him over and over again.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-25/scene-25-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 6.687,
          "duration_frames": 201
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-25-line-02",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "I want to hear God like Moses — and believe, no matter what!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-25/scene-25-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 3.622,
          "duration_frames": 109
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 10.91,
      "duration_frames": 327
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-26",
      "scene_type": "activity",
      "title": "Application — A-B-C of Salvation",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-26",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-4a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-26-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "If you are saved, thank God for His tender care. If the blood of Jesus has not covered your sin, you are marked for death!",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-26/scene-26-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 9.52,
          "duration_frames": 286
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-26-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "To be rescued — A — Admit you have sinned. B — Believe Jesus died for you. C — Call on His name!",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-26/scene-26-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 8.626,
          "duration_frames": 259
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 18.746,
      "duration_frames": 562
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-27",
      "scene_type": "recap",
      "title": "Today We Learned",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-27",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-5a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-27-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Today we learned about the Passover — Mighty Hand, Tender Care.",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-27/scene-27-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 4.481,
          "duration_frames": 134
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-27-line-02",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The lamb's blood saved the Israelites. The destroyer passed over every marked house. God's mighty hand kept His promise. And Jesus is the Lamb of God for the whole world.",
          "emotion": "gentle",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-27/scene-27-line-02.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 13.595,
          "duration_frames": 408
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-27-line-03",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Thank God for His tender care today!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-27/scene-27-line-03.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 2.728,
          "duration_frames": 82
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration_seconds": 22.005,
      "duration_frames": 660
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-28",
      "scene_type": "outro",
      "title": "See You Next Week!",
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-28",
        "type": "title-card",
        "bg_color": "#1a2845",
        "eyebrow": "✦ Great Job Today, Friends! ✦",
        "title": "See You\nNext Week!",
        "subtitle": "Set free by the blood of the Lamb! 🐑",
        "footer": "Next time: God leads His people into the wilderness — stay tuned!",
        "animation": "fade-in"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-28-line-01",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Great job today, friends! You remembered the story of the Passover — the blood on the door, the mighty hand, the tender care. See you next week, when God leads His people into the wilderness!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-28/scene-28-line-01.mp3",
          "duration_seconds": 12.968,
          "duration_frames": 389
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-outro-chime",
